Changes for hgdownload (2026-11-05):
  Go implementation using the standard library; request signing limited to the
  playback hash branch selected by the reference implementation; bounded official
  HTTPS transport; ephemeral anonymous registration; exact requested-episode
  matching; compatible H.264/HEVC selection; Spade parsing; local FFmpeg media
  decryption/remuxing; FFprobe duration/dimension validation; atomic publication.
  No account credentials, fixed registered identities, device tokens or third-party
  signing service are copied. Synthetic fixtures cross-check the JS/Go signatures.

The older webpage search and series-list implementation follows the local
findrss-scripts/rss/hongguo.js reference. Webpage SEO previews are no longer used
as download sources. Existing preview files remain untouched.

FFmpeg and FFprobe are external executables installed by the user. Their binaries
are not included. Synthetic test media contains only generated black frames and
silent audio. No downloaded drama media is included in the project.

