Youku website integration (2026-11-05):
  youku_browser.mjs uses the user's installed Ego Lite browser and the official
  Youku page's MTOP runtime to request compatible HLS metadata. No player SDK,
  fixed cKey, account cookie or proprietary DRM implementation is distributed.
  The Go downloader independently handles separate CMAF audio/video playlists,
  local timestamp correction without re-encoding, and per-track duration checks.
  Ego Lite is an external runtime and is not included in this project.

